# backslash-text: What does XPPAUT 8.2.2 do with text after a backslash (`\5`)?
# xpp: v@3=3
# pc: ODE0075
# ruling: XPPAUT continues the line and drops the `5`. PhaseCont does the same and warns (ODE0075) with the dropped text, since the file no longer says what the author wrote (language.md, Lines).
x'=1+\5
2
x(0)=0
aux v=x
@ total=1,dt=0.5,meth=euler
